_server&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px"&gt;저장한 맵 (.yaml · .pgm) 불러오기&lt;br&gt;발행 /map&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C77700;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1A1A1A;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="680" y="185" width="200" height="80" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c18" value='&lt;b&gt;lifecycle_manager_localization&lt;/b&gt;  &lt;span style="font-size:10px"&gt;두 노드 켜기·끄기 (configure → activate)&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBF3E4;strokeColor=#B8A07A;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1A1A1A;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="430" y="282" width="450" height="32" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c19" value='&lt;b&gt;RViz2 (PC)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px"&gt;2D Pose Estimate로 초기 위치 지정&lt;br&gt;Nav2 Goal · 맵 · 경로 보기&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#777777;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1A1A1A;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;arcSize=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1080" y="140" width="230" height="70" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c20" value='Navigation (Nav2)  &lt;span style="font-weight:normal;font-size:12px"&gt;(nav2.launch.py · 10개)&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EEF7F0;strokeColor=#2E7D4F;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=15;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#2E7D4F;align=center;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=4;arcSize=3;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="400" y="380" width="1240" height="380" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c21" value='&lt;b&gt;collision_monitor&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:10px"&gt;장애물 가까우면 감속·정지&lt;br&gt;cmd_vel_smoothed → /cmd_vel&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#2E7D4F;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=12;fontColor=#1A1A1A;align=cente